{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026EjCaVVY0qx1793267974.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中共二十屆五中全會閉幕，發表會議公報，增選中央軍委副主席張升民為政治局委員。</p><p></p><p>【新華社報導】</p><p>張升民，男，漢族，1958年8月生，陜西武功人，1978年2月入伍，1979年7月加入中國共產黨，中央黨校研究生學歷。</p><p></p><p>現任中央政治局委員、中共中央軍事委員會副主席、中華人民共和國中央軍事委員會副主席、中央紀律檢查委員會副書記、火箭軍上將軍銜。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:42:11.174576+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":169,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T09:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T13:18:31.038346+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T10:38:25.614334+00:00","content_hash":"eb9e79ea61db872c7fef193a398b7de10a91daf9e2f46eeaa9e14f94c29ed34b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}